{
  "$schema": "./case.schema.json",
  "suite": "character-2k",
  "title": "Fuobe Character swap in 2K · the regenerate's start noise",
  "description": "The Character swap at 1080p / 2K / 4K (src/lib/catalog/sharpen.ts) on Genjutsu's route (POST /api/genjutsu), on your clip and character in local/genjutsu/: person.mp4 (5–15 s, one continuous shot, at least 1080p, the person visible in its first frame) and character.png (a consenting person or a drawn character). On your GPU the 768p swap is redrawn by Open-H3 Regenerate and only the character is composited back over the footage; each case tries one start noise (character.sharpenSigma: 0.7, 0.8 or the release's 0.909) against the 768p swap. In the cloud fal's H3 makes 2K itself (no start noise), for reference. Scores: identity (the face against the character picture: does the redraw keep who they are?), background (the frame's outer ring against the source clip: does the background stay as filmed?) and temporal (flicker). Needs a GPU ComfyUI with OPEN_H3_REGEN=1 and H3_RELAY=1 for the open cases.",
  "original": [
    "fuobe-character-swap"
  ],
  "kind": "video",
  "decides": "The default start noise of the Character swap's 2K finish on your GPU (SHARPEN_SIGMA in src/lib/catalog/sharpen.ts, now 0.8). In one open run on at least 3 clips, the sigma whose identity is highest within 0.01 of the 768p swap's, with bgDiff within 0.002 of the best, becomes the default in a reviewed change; a tie keeps 0.8. A sigma whose identity falls more than 0.03 below the 768p swap is never the default.",
  "targets": {
    "open": {
      "models": [
        "fuobe-character-swap"
      ]
    },
    "cloud": {
      "models": [
        "fuobe-character-swap"
      ]
    },
    "demo": {
      "models": [
        "fuobe-character-swap"
      ]
    }
  },
  "defaults": {
    "seeds": [
      1001,
      2002
    ],
    "metrics": [
      "identity",
      "background",
      "temporal"
    ],
    "timeoutSeconds": 3600,
    "candidate": "original"
  },
  "variants": {
    "original": {
      "description": "The Character swap as Genjutsu runs it"
    }
  },
